On Air and Astral I usually have a couple of B!oFH out of the bag.
There are no fire traps there and with reflection they are probably
safe.

Some other ideas:
- using either/both rings of Free Action and Conflict on Astral/Air;
- crossing the Air plane from path with no clouds (I never bothered
  with it, but I see some people do);
- if you are low on wands on teleport, be prepared with ?oCharging. In
  any case, have them identified and instead of last zap break them
  for area effect;
- stormbringer is a very good weapon, and draining titan's and Archon
  levels may be a good way to lower their chance of casting spells;
- I don't like the Helm of opposite alignment idea because that
  usually makes you lose protection points: better wish for *trice.
